  "title": "Immix Biopharma Announces Closing of $150 Million Underwritten Offering of Common Stock",
  "summary": "– Financing includes leading U.S. biotechnology institutional investors and mutual funds – LOS ANGELES, CA, May 22, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Immix Biopharma, Inc. (“ImmixBio”, “Company”, “We” or “Us” or “IMMX”), a global leader in AL Amyloidosis, today announced the closing of its previously announced underwritten registered offering of 16,778,524 shares of its common stock […]",
